# Customer Advisory Board Meeting

**Date:** January 18, 2026
**Attendees:** MedSync Health leadership + 10 customer representatives

## Purpose

The Customer Advisory Board (CAB) provides a forum for our most strategic customers to share feedback, influence our product roadmap, and network with peers.

## Agenda

1. Welcome and introductions
2. Product roadmap presentation
3. Customer feedback session
4. Networking lunch

## Key Feedback

- Customers are excited about the Analytics Suite
- Request for more training resources and documentation
- Interest in a mobile app for care coordinators
- Desire for more frequent product updates

## Action Items

- Product team will prioritize mobile app exploration
- Customer Success will develop additional training materials
- Marketing will increase the frequency of product update communications
